<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109780" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑφαίρ-εσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>taking away from under,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰγνυῶν ὑ.,</span> in wrestling, <i><span class="en">
				Sopat.
			</span></i> ap. Sch.T.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.729
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>purloining, pilfering,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ γραμματείου</span> from the clerks'
			office, Test. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				45.61
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζεύγους χεροψελίων ὑ. ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					10.1128.23
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>, cf. Mitteis<i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				372 ii 8
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				 iii 5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>subtraction,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑνός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.574
				</span></i>
			; <i>reduction,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ μεγέθους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diog.Oen.
					39
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴνου καὶ τροφῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.46
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑφαίρεσιν ποιεῖσθαι τῶν
			ὑποκειμένων</span> to undertake the <i>moderation</i> or
				<i>mitigation</i> of . . , <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				15.8.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> in Gramm.,
				<i>omission</i> of a letter, Sch. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				149
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				389.6
			</span></i>: opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκοπή</span> (which
			involves loss of a syllable), Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.247
			</span></i>.</div>
